    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d394">

                <pb facs="0539" n="429" xml:id="pg429"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/2620: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Howell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-11T22:00:00+00:00">November 11, 1931—10
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 11—5:22 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>724. Your 530, November 9, 4 p.m., and my 721, November 11, noon.<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="d394-f1"/></p>
                <p>This afternoon in talking with Briand I carefully gave him the substance of your
                    530. He said he would endeavor to have proposed at next week’s conference the
                    plan which is described in paragraph (2) of your telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Howell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
